{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1409599-101-creepypasta-plots","id":1409599,"title":"101 CreepyPasta Plots","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-08-21T12:01:40-07:00","id":1409599,"title":"101 CreepyPasta Plots","content":"Trying to come up with mysterious horror story scenarios for my game and was hoping to get a list of simple Urban Legend/Creepy Pasta esque stories. Additionally I added a couple that are Urban Legends about technology that I stole from Five Nights at Freddy's and Persona.<ol class=\"decimal\"><li><u><b>Slender Man</b></u>: A collection of vintage photographs depicting the &quot;Slenderman&quot; recently sold in an online auction. Those who purchased the pictures have either gone insane or have been found dead, under mysterious circumstances. CCTV capturing several of the deaths cut to static moments before the victim is killed.</li> <li><u><b>Channel Zero</b></u>: In 2006 analog tv signals switch to higher band digital signals. Recently an Urban Legend has cropped up that if you turn on a TV with old analog rabbit ears you can find &quot;Channel Zero&quot;. The rumors range from the channel playing TV show episodes that never aired and sometimes a special program shows up involving a real person. When the special program finishes that person is found dead.</li> <li><b><u>Robert the Doll</u></b>: Recently a doll was shipped to a nearby museum and stolen. The tale of Robert the Doll terrorizing those who don't ask permission to play with him and take his picture are grisly. Its no wonder that when a string of pawn shop owners start going insane that Robert the Doll isn't far behind.</li> <li><b><u>The Goatman:</u></b> Campers in the nearby national park came back speaking of a Goat faced man stalking their campgrounds. Many keep there tents shut and hope he passes by, but those caught outside find themselves convulsing and speaking gibberish.</li> <li><u><b>Haunted Animatronics</b></u>: An urban legend states that if you stay after dark at the kid's pizzeria the animal shaped animatronics come to life. So far the pizzeria has had a couple of break ins, but no sign of anything stolen. At least five children have gone missing and there is a nasty odor coming from the animatronics.</li> <li><u><b>Dark Hour</b></u>: Urban legend states that there is a point between 24:00 hours and 0:00 hours of each day that falls between, an hour between days. There is a message board where people go to talk about experiencing this phenomenon. They talk of a world similar to the real one with slight variations and things scuttling in the dark. It is believed that if you die during this time your soul will be trapped there.</li> <li><u><b>Joker Phenomenon</b></u>: Urban legend that calling your own phone number will summon an entity called the Joker who will kill whoever you request.</li> </ol>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25291-donteatrawhagis","name":"DontEatRawHagis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"211"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}